      "message": "Thanks for checking!\nYeah, now I remembered that we have special handling for `--test-launcher-bot-mode` in ANGLE here https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/angle/src/tests/test_utils/runner/TestSuite.cpp;l\u003d1377;drc\u003d25390156aefd6991c268c6c2c1477e9bb1d4a6f1\nbut since Dawn doesn\u0027t have its own custom harness, it can only use what GTest has in store.\nThere is a total number of tests in output.json, this helps a bit.",
